{%- comment -%}
  Melt: the eyebrow and name shown on a product card.

    eyebrow = Product type                   e.g. "Scented Candle", "Reed Diffuser", "Wax Melts"
    name    = snippets/melt-product-name.liquid (the product title, or Fragrance + Short Title,
              per the section's name setting)    e.g. "Wisteria Tall & Fat"
  Products without a type (gift cards, hampers) show no eyebrow. Display only: the Shopify
  product title is unchanged. The product page's own heading is separate and not affected.

  Accepts:
  - part: {String} 'eyebrow' or 'name'
  - product: {Object} the product
  - show_eyebrow: {Boolean} whether the card shows an eyebrow
  - eyebrow_color: {Color} eyebrow colour (optional)
  - name_source: {String} passed to melt-product-name (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'melt-card-label', part: 'name', product: card_product, show_eyebrow: true %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'eyebrow' -%}
  {%- if show_eyebrow and product.type != blank -%}
    {%- render 'melt-eyebrow', text: product.type, color: eyebrow_color, class: 'card__eyebrow' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- render 'melt-product-name', product: product, source: name_source -%}
{%- endif -%}
